  "title": "Slow Cooker Funeral Potatoes (Hash Brown Casserole)",
  "description": "Funeral potatoes are easy to make in a crockpot with hash browns, condensed soup, sour cream, garlic, and Cheddar for rich and cheesy potato casserole.",
